    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2006-07-24"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2013-06-30"></period-end>
     <target value="Yes"></target>
     <actual value="No">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The implementation of the PRS suffered delays due to the delays in the formation of the new Government. The PRS is now beingimplemented with a renewed focus on results and budgetary resources allocated to it. However, these resources currently take theform of around US$500 million allocated to projects which are designated as &#x201c;poverty projects.&#x201d; This does not yet amount to PRSintegration in the budget, which should be cross-cutting and not a project &#x201c;enclave.&#x201d; In any event, the new survey will be neededto assist better targeting of these projects.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
